  "limitations": "MR-08 remains IN_PROGRESS and the complete 17-package goal is not achieved. Current query origins require a registered local replica; general directory/ingress routing outside voting/read membership is not established. The remaining read audit includes active captured ordinary Context/Storage paths, counter native/Axum HTTP consistency/token options, query saturation, queued deadlines and delayed replies. All seven named cases now exist, but case-name presence alone does not close these requirements. Three embedded nodes on one machine and a loopback three-process transport fixture do not qualify independent machines, power loss, zones, production capacity or full release/scaling gates. Four ignored helper entry points are excluded from the owning count. Native Rust callbacks are trusted/cooperative. S3 archive/restore, snapshots, automatic membership repair, effects, operations/release/scaling and all later original packages remain pending. Existing vendored warnings are retained.",
